+      {%- endif %}
+
+    - Trigger the wheel builder with the `[cd build]` commit marker. See also the
+      `workflow runs of the wheel builder
+      <https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/actions/workflows/wheels.yml>`_.
+
